sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Student
  participant UI as Study Room UI
  participant API as Backend /ai/chat
  participant AI as AI Provider
  participant DB as MongoDB

  U->>UI: Ask study question
  UI->>API: POST /ai/chat
  API->>AI: provider.chat(messages)
  AI-->>API: AI response
  API->>DB: Save chat history
  API-->>UI: Response
  UI-->>U: Render reply
